WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.125
The long and the short of it.

00:00:02.175 --> 00:00:05.745
Brand building is long-term and emotional, lifting your base.

00:00:05.795 --> 00:00:09.330
Activation is short-term and rational, spiking sales.

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:12.082
The benchmark is about sixty forty.

00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:15.771
Brent Smart found Telstra at just twenty percent brand.

00:00:15.821 --> 00:00:17.552
He didn't leap to sixty.

00:00:17.602 --> 00:00:20.221
His first move was fifty fifty.

00:00:20.933 --> 00:00:21.980
Here's why.

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:22.830
A sale cuts the price and shoppers rush in,

00:00:22.737 --> 00:00:26.013
then vanish when it ends.

00:00:26.063 --> 00:00:28.939
Brand building keeps people coming back.

00:00:29.633 --> 00:00:30.786
Use it like this:

00:00:30.836 --> 00:00:32.012
plan both speeds,

00:00:32.062 --> 00:00:33.286
aim for sixty forty,

00:00:33.336 --> 00:00:36.551
and agree brand health measures before year one.
